00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:27.340
So let me show you some
critical action items here.

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:31.540
So to make success in
machine learning projects,

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:35.170
first you should define
your criteria, or threshold,

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.140
for your machine learning model.

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:40.470
In this case, we
