00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:55.590
model works well or not or
good enough to deploy that

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:58.170
to real application.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:01.380
And the second, we should
keep collecting data

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:04.650
so that we have more and
more unbiased data set

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:06.660
that reflects the real world.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.880
And the last but
not least, we should

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:12.260
keep monitoring the performance
of the machine learning model

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:15.780
so that we can determine
the timing of the deployment

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:19.380
and also retraining of the
machine learning model.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:25.290
So today-- actually, to
