00:25:03.230 --> 00:25:07.100
But in summary, in a real
machine learning project,

00:25:07.100 --> 00:25:09.080
there are three
critical action items.

00:25:09.080 --> 00:25:12.385
The first is defining
threshold and criteria

00:25:12.385 --> 00:25:13.960
of your machine learning model.

00:25:13.960 --> 00:25:18.250
And the second is
continuous data collection.

00:25:18.250 --> 00:25:22.690
And the third is
continuous monitoring.

00:25:22.690 --> 00:25:26.800
Those action items help
you to make success

00:25:26.800 --> 00:25:28.440
in machine learning project.

00:25:28.440 --> 00:25:29.050
Thank you.

