00:26:42.200 --> 00:26:45.900
So using this kind of
monitoring dashboard,

00:26:45.900 --> 00:26:49.060
they could realize
they had a problem.

00:26:49.060 --> 00:26:51.350
That's the value
of this monitoring.

00:26:51.350 --> 00:26:55.470
So can you turn back
